CORE no-new-smt
round-to-integral.i
--arch x86_64 --os linux
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Rounding x86 80-bit extended long double values to integers, including results
that carry into the exponent.
The new SMT2 back end (--incremental-smt2-solver) does not yet support
floatbv_round_to_integral, as it does not implement extractbit.
